TITLE:: FxParamPanel
summary:: an FxParamUnit's controls as one view
categories:: Libraries>FxKit
related:: Classes/FxParamUnit, Classes/FxParamGUI, Classes/FxChainPanel

DESCRIPTION::
The top row, the display, and a row of knobs per section of the table. It is what link::Classes/FxParamGUI:: and link::Classes/FxChainPanel:: show.

code::
t = Tunnel.new;
w = Window("mine", Rect(100, 100, 860, 600));
p = FxParamPanel(t);
w.layout = VLayout(p.view);
w.onClose = { p.remove };
w.front;
p.running = true;
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
It follows one unit.
ARGUMENT:: unit
ARGUMENT:: parent

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: view
The view.

METHOD:: unit
What it follows.

METHOD:: display
The unit's display.

METHOD:: bars
